Item to test:
   PyORBit incompatibility with non-ORBit2 servers (MICO in this sample)

Tested with:
 
 mico 2.3.11-1
 liborbit2 2.10.2-1.1
 python2.3-pyorbit 2.0.1-1 
 gcc 3.3.4-3
 system: Debian SID with Linux 2.4.22


To run:

 $ ./mico_server &
 $ ./mico_client `cat hello.ior`         % works fine
 $ ./pyorbit_client.py `cat hello.ior`   % client stalled or server segfault
 
In ethereal_capture.dmp you can view the traffic for the commands above.


 
